[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0010","text":"欢迎来到……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0020","text":"“ALSTROEMERIA复活节”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0030","text":"大家——！\n今天谢谢你们来参加！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0040","text":"企划……\n准备了很多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0050","text":"请大家\n尽情享受吧♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0060","text":"第一个活动是～……\n“寻蛋游戏”！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0070","text":"在指定的区域里\n藏着蛋形的胶囊，去找出来吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0080","text":"找到最多的人\n我们会送上一份特别的礼物哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0090","text":"大家……\n加油……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_04_0100","text":"限时30分钟！\n那么，预备……开始！"}]
